flowchart LR
  accTitle: Titan data and control flow
  accDescr: Sensors send measurements through peripheral and device drivers to the application. The application controls actuators through drivers, records data, and exchanges telemetry and commands with ground systems.
  sensors["Sensors / ADC"] --> drivers["Peripheral +<br/>device drivers"]
  drivers --> app["Application<br/>State and control"]
  app --> outputs["Output drivers<br/>and actuators"]
  app --> storage["Storage / logs"]
  app <--> comms["Packets +<br/>comms drivers"]
  comms <--> ground["Ground systems"]
